1.e4 1...e5 2.Nf3 2...Nc6 3.Bc4 3...Bc5 4.c3 4...Qf6 5.d4 5...exd4 6.e5 6...Qg6 7.cxd4 7...Bb4+ 8.Nc3 8...Qxg2 9.Rg1 9...Qh3 10.Bxf7+ *

[Event "Chapter 2: Sidelines After 3...Bc5 / Study 2: Black Plays 4...h6 and 4...Qf6  / Variation 1"]
